 "the_finding": "MORE PLANES DO NOT RESCUE IT AND THE DESIGN DOCUMENT'S OWN CONSTRUCTION IS WORSE THAN UNIT AMPLITUDES.  The best worst-lag band mass over every configuration tried is 0.3431 at twelve planes, against a registered threshold of 0.90, and it DECREASES beyond twelve because the HIGH-index planes traverse less than a hundredth of a radian across the window (plane 24 moves 0.0083 radians end to end) and contribute a near constant that flattens the peak.  To reach 0.90 the pre-softmax score range would have to be 671.8 against the parent's measured 10.72 -- a factor of 63."
